WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.717
Row-level validation is useful but managers and
analysts often need a summary This

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:12.268
query combines several issue detectors with UNION
ALL Then it groups

00:00:12.295 --> 00:00:17.908
by entity and issue type to count how many problems
exist This turns

00:00:17.921 --> 00:00:20.724
cleaning logic into a measurable quality report
